        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Yes, a treadmill is good exercise.</strong> It delivers the
            well-established benefits of walking and running — heart and lung fitness,
            weight-bearing loading, better mood and sleep — and makes them available every day at
            exactly the effort you choose.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Its limits are real: monotony, repetitive loading and no strength training. Use it
            consistently, vary the sessions, add strength work twice a week, and start with our
